        "title": "“我们遭到了袭击！”加拿大强力反制：对美等额关税9月8日生效，午夜紧急召回谈判团队",
        "uri": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3780061"
      },
      "author": {
        "avatar": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/bc3971d4-2d62-4d54-b1dd-7058c60c6ffa",
        "display_name": "罗俊",
        "id": 694840,
        "is_followed": false,
